{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いま\n1部と2部の間です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんは\nお昼ご飯何食べるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は2部と3部の間に食べよ〜\n今日は何かな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう帰っちゃったかたは\n来てくれてありがとう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから来るかたは\n待ってるね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「「答えちゃうお( °_ゝ°)ノ」」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段から朝ご飯ちゃんと食べる人？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\nうん、食べる！\n朝起きてすぐ食べるのが習慣だから\n食べないと変な感じ(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田って笑い上戸？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n中2の時に部活の先輩に\n聞かれたことある(゜ロ゜)\nそうなのか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/02/16/8334113/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4thの曲がもう\n懐かしい感じがする。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}